# The tool runs on Linux too (Raspberry Pi): LF everywhere, also when checked
# out on Windows - a bash script with CRLF fails with "$'\r': command not found".
* text=auto eol=lf
# ...except Windows scripts: cmd.exe mis-handles "goto" labels in LF-only .bat files.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
